# effekseer: node 0.0.0.2.0.0 "粒子色付け": a random colour per particle: its mean used
# effekseer: node 0.0.0.2.0.1 "glow": a random colour per particle: its mean used
# effekseer: node 0.0.0.2.1 "ライン": a fixed sprite with many instances: drawn facing the camera
# effekseer: node 0.0.0.2.1 "ライン": a sprite scaled unevenly: drawn square at its mean
# effekseer: node 0.0.0.2.1.0 "ラインglow": a fixed sprite with many instances: drawn facing the camera
# effekseer: node 0.0.0.2.1.0 "ラインglow": a random colour per particle: its mean used
# effekseer: node 0.1.1 "リング縁": a UV region of a texture whose size is not known (not a PNG)
# effekseer: node 0.2.0 "ライン": a y-axis billboard: drawn facing the camera
# effekseer: node 0.2.0 "ライン": a sprite scaled unevenly: drawn square at its mean
# effekseer: node 0.2.0.0 "色": a y-axis billboard: drawn facing the camera
# effekseer: node 0.2.0.0 "色": a random colour per particle: its mean used
# effekseer: node 0.3.0.0 "色": a random colour per particle: its mean used
